WEBVTT

00:00:07.285 --> 00:00:10.685
Wait! Wait!
I didn't mean that kind of shoot!

00:00:10.725 --> 00:00:12.845
COMPUTER: Correction acknowledged.
Deploying chute.

00:00:12.965 --> 00:00:14.525
Whoa!

00:00:19.525 --> 00:00:20.525
McQueen!

00:00:25.125 --> 00:00:26.205
Whoa! What's this?

00:00:26.525 --> 00:00:27.685
Whoa!

00:00:31.885 --> 00:00:33.605
McQueen! McQueen!

00:00:36.685 --> 00:00:37.685
Waagh!

00:00:40.205 --> 00:00:42.045
Let me through! Let me through!

00:00:42.205 --> 00:00:44.565
Let me in!
I got to get through to warn McQueen!

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:46.605
You cannot-a come through here!
Back up.

00:00:46.725 --> 00:00:48.205
We have a lunatic at gate 9.

00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:52.085
I was disguised as a tow truck
to infiltrate this lemonhead meeting

00:00:52.165 --> 00:00:55.205
and my weapons system's done
misinterperated what I'm saying!

00:00:55.245 --> 00:00:57.965
-Lunatic at gate 9.
-McQueen! McQueen!

00:00:58.045 --> 00:01:00.245
-You are the champion!
-This way, signore.

00:01:00.285 --> 00:01:02.245
-MATER: McQueen!
-Mater?

00:01:02.365 --> 00:01:04.805
-MATER: McQueen.
-Give us a pose!

00:01:04.885 --> 00:01:07.205
-McQueen!
-Stop moving. Stop!

00:01:07.245 --> 00:01:09.605
Where you going?

00:01:09.685 --> 00:01:10.685
Stop!

00:01:10.925 --> 00:01:13.285
-McQueen!
-That really sounded like...

00:01:13.405 --> 00:01:14.605
Mater!

00:01:14.685 --> 00:01:16.245
-Mater?
-Signore?

00:01:16.285 --> 00:01:18.445
MATER: McQueen!
They're gonna kill you!

00:01:18.485 --> 00:01:19.885
McQUEEN: Mater!

00:01:19.965 --> 00:01:21.245
Excuse me.

00:01:21.405 --> 00:01:23.165
No, where are you going?

00:01:23.285 --> 00:01:25.005
Scusi. Mater!

00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:26.645
-McQueen!
-Scusi.

00:01:26.765 --> 00:01:29.245
Mater! Mater!

00:01:29.285 --> 00:01:31.285
Mater, I'm so glad to see you.

00:01:31.325 --> 00:01:34.445
Lightning McQueen!
I am a huge fan.

00:01:34.485 --> 00:01:36.125
I'm sorry, I thought I heard...

00:01:36.245 --> 00:01:40.245
That was me. I said, "You killed
out there today. You're the best."

00:01:40.285 --> 00:01:43.085
-What? I mean, thanks.
-Right this way, signore.

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:45.125
I really thought I heard my friend.

00:01:46.965 --> 00:01:50.285
In England, you'll be finished!
At the finish line.

00:01:51.325 --> 00:01:53.645
-Wait, what?
-The press is waiting.

00:01:53.725 --> 00:01:55.245
Come-a with me, please.

00:01:55.285 --> 00:01:57.285
(MUFFLED CRIES)

00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:00.805
Let me go!

00:02:00.885 --> 00:02:03.005
You actually care about that race car.

00:02:03.485 --> 00:02:05.485
A pity you didn't warn him in time.

00:02:06.525 --> 00:02:08.045
(GASPS)

00:02:13.325 --> 00:02:15.245
MATER: "Idiot"?
Is that how you see me?

00:02:15.325 --> 00:02:18.365
FINN: That's how everyone sees you.
I tell you, that's the genius of it.

00:02:18.485 --> 00:02:20.485
No one realizes they're being fooled

00:02:20.565 --> 00:02:23.325
because they're too busy laughing
at the fool.

00:02:23.445 --> 00:02:25.445
At the fool... (ECHOES)

00:02:25.925 --> 00:02:27.725
Excuse me!

00:02:27.845 --> 00:02:29.765
(IN JAPANESE)
Domo arigato!

00:02:29.845 --> 00:02:31.165
Yeah!

00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:35.325
You done good. You got all the leaves.

00:02:35.485 --> 00:02:37.965
-Check out that tow truck.
-I wonder who that guy's with.

00:02:38.045 --> 00:02:41.085
Will you guys excuse me
just for one little second?

00:02:41.485 --> 00:02:43.725
Now that's a scoop of ice cream!

00:02:47.085 --> 00:02:48.525
Aargh!

00:02:48.605 --> 00:02:50.205
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:50.325 --> 00:02:53.565
Somebody get me water!
Oh, sweet relief.

00:02:53.685 --> 00:02:55.045
Mater!

00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:57.125
(LAUGHTER)

00:02:59.885 --> 00:03:01.805
But I never leak oil. Never.

00:03:01.885 --> 00:03:04.285
Get a hold of yourself.
You're making a scene!

00:03:04.525 --> 00:03:06.765
Wait a minute.
I didn't screw you up, did I?

00:03:06.885 --> 00:03:10.165
-I lost the race because of you!
-Maybe if I talked to somebody...

00:03:10.205 --> 00:03:11.925
I don't need your help!

00:03:12.005 --> 00:03:13.965
I don't want your help.

00:03:14.045 --> 00:03:16.045
Your help... (ECHOES)

00:03:16.645 --> 00:03:18.605
Bang the gong. Get it on!

00:03:18.725 --> 00:03:20.765
McQUEEN: Listen,
this isn't Radiator Springs.

00:03:20.885 --> 00:03:24.205
This is exactly why I don't bring
you along to these things!

00:03:25.245 --> 00:03:27.245
(BELL CHIMES)

00:03:35.165 --> 00:03:37.765
Holley! Finn! Where are we?

00:03:37.885 --> 00:03:41.165
We're in London, Mater,
inside Big Bentley.

00:03:46.805 --> 00:03:48.565
Whoa!

00:03:48.805 --> 00:03:49.965
Whoa!

00:03:57.205 --> 00:03:59.165
Oh, this... This is all my fault.

00:03:59.245 --> 00:04:01.205
Don't be a fool, Mater.

00:04:01.245 --> 00:04:03.245
But I am, remember? You said so.

00:04:03.325 --> 00:04:05.245
When did I... Oh.

00:04:05.405 --> 00:04:09.405
Mater, I was complimenting you
on what a good spy you are.

00:04:09.445 --> 00:04:11.285
I'm not a spy! (ECHOES)

00:04:14.405 --> 00:04:16.805
I've been trying to tell you that
the whole time.

00:04:16.925 --> 00:04:19.085
I really am just a tow truck.

00:04:19.165 --> 00:04:21.045
Finn, he's not joking.

00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:25.005
-I know.
-You were right, Finn. I'm a fool.

00:04:25.085 --> 00:04:28.445
And what's happened to McQueen
is 'cause I'm such a big one.

00:04:29.205 --> 00:04:31.205
This is all my fault.

00:04:34.285 --> 00:04:37.085
-Good. You're up.
-And just in time.

00:04:37.165 --> 00:04:39.845
Professor Z wanted you
to have a front-row seat,

00:04:39.965 --> 00:04:41.885
for the death of Lightning McQueen.

00:04:42.005 --> 00:04:45.085
-He's still alive?
-Not for much longer.

00:04:49.565 --> 00:04:50.565
Whoa!

00:04:51.005 --> 00:04:52.125
Huh?

00:04:57.965 --> 00:05:00.885
-We came as soon as you called.
-I called to talk to Mater.

00:05:01.045 --> 00:05:03.285
It never occurred to me
he wouldn't be there.

00:05:03.325 --> 00:05:05.485
Sheriff is talking to Scotland Yard now.

00:05:05.525 --> 00:05:08.525
And Sarge is in touch with his friends
in the British military.

00:05:08.645 --> 00:05:10.325
You just need
to focus on the race.

00:05:10.405 --> 00:05:13.005
I know but, Sally with everything
going on, I'm not sure...

00:05:13.085 --> 00:05:14.125
(HORN TOOTS)

00:05:14.205 --> 00:05:16.525
-Sir Axlerod.
-I'm sorry to interrupt.

00:05:16.685 --> 00:05:19.845
-It's all right.
-I just wanted to personally thank you.

00:05:19.885 --> 00:05:24.845
Because after Italy, I was finished,
and then you gave me one last shot.

00:05:24.925 --> 00:05:25.965
Listen...

00:05:26.005 --> 00:05:29.445
I probably shouldn't be saying this,
but I hope you win today.

00:05:29.525 --> 00:05:32.765
You show the world
that they've been wrong about allinol.

00:05:33.525 --> 00:05:35.845
Mater would want you to race.

00:05:36.685 --> 00:05:38.645
All right. For Mater.

